  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00920-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyIndicatorAndTargetRelatingToSustainability contextRef="FilingDateInstant">ウェブサイト</jpcrp030000-asr_E00920-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyIndicatorAndTargetRelatingToSustainability>
