&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:1.9pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;信託設定及び TSR Peer Group (注３) の設定&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
